{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧第一块大字，尤其金色的“憋着一股气”和“当作自己人”；随后中部第二块同样醒目的大字争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人心里还憋着气，想起过去曾被当作自己人，短暂地高兴了一下。是否处于离开后的处境，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、心酸；能看到情绪变化，但不容易一眼理清变化的原因。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开后才发现心里空了；从前的日子已经回不去，以及离开以后是否真的会更好过这一层矛盾和疑问。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大字都很醒目，上方金色文字与中部白色大字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里：上块交代憋闷和短暂高兴，下块才交代心酸、过去无法重来和对离开后的疑问，需要拼接。\",\n    \"单块长句包含多个层次，不能只靠扫到放大的关键词就完整判断处境和情绪关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a50781d-c714-4f35-b29d-367c1c3ad2cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012807459666Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:28:41.274360+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ce3812cb21d74ce17def9343e98c7ea502172f258007299bf295cea36f9d566", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668